  "notes": "Do not confuse with the homophone {制服|せいふく} (uniform). {征服|せいふく} uses {征|せい} (military campaign), while {制服|せいふく} uses {制|せい} (regulate).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {世界|せかい}{征服|せいふく}: world conquest/domination\n- {征服|せいふく}{者|しゃ}: conqueror\n- {征服|せいふく}{欲|よく}: desire to conquer\n- {自然|しぜん}を{征服|せいふく}する: to conquer nature\n- {山|やま}を{征服|せいふく}する: to conquer a mountain\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: ～を{征服|せいふく}する\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {克服|こくふく}: overcoming (difficulties, weaknesses — not territories)\n- {制圧|せいあつ}: suppression, bringing under control",
